# Kotlin + Compose

- Language: Kotlin. Null-safe. No `!!` on production paths without an ADR.
- UI: Jetpack Compose unless an approved ADR says otherwise.
- Concurrency: coroutines + Flow. No `GlobalScope`.
- Read `TRACK.md`. Do not add tablet pane work on a phone-only track unless the spec changed.
- TAK tracks: Adapter at the host seam. Domain stays free of `com.atakmap` types.
